! ---- CHECKS, read by tests/verify_mcp_page.py 111 ----------------
! FORTY-EIGHT ROWS AND NO SYMBOLS.  Lines 1 and 4 are SLC cards and
! print no BINARY OUTPUT, so they are not rows; the NAME column is
! empty on all fifty lines, so there is no symbol to declare.  See
! "WHAT THE FORTY-EIGHT !CHECK ROWS ACTUALLY CHECK" above for which
! of these are independent and which are one fact repeated.
!CHECK 215050.00 | 215265.00 80 | line  2 SIC,S T IC
!CHECK 215050.40 | 215471.04 00 | line  3 BD,S IFA E
!CHECK 215051.00 | 215265.00 80 | line  5 SIC,ST IC
!CHECK 215051.40 | 215131.04 00 | line  6 BD,SIPT+22.
!CHECK 215052.00 | 215265.00 80 | line  7 SIC,ST IC
!CHECK 215052.40 | 215132.04 00 | line  8 BD,SIPT+23.
