!CHECK 215061.40 | 215141.04 00 | line 22 BD,SIPT+30.0
!CHECK 215062.00 | 215265.00 80 | line 23 SIC,STIC
!CHECK 215062.40 | 215142.04 00 | line 24 BD,SIPT+31.0
